<article id="post-15031" class="post-15031 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-seminars-webinars category-industrial-base tag-forum tag-industrial-base tag-seminar tag-supply-chain"  itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork">

	
	<div class="post-entry">

		
<h1 class="entry-title post-title responsive" itemprop="headline">Office of Space Commerce and AIA to Host Commercial Space Supply Chain Forum</h1>

<div class="post-meta">
					<span class="entry-date">
					Posted on <i class="icon-calendar" aria-hidden="true"></i><span></span><span class="meta-prep meta-prep-author posted" itemprop="datePublished"><a href="https://space.commerce.gov/office-of-space-commerce-and-aia-to-host-commercial-space-supply-chain-forum/" aria-label="Office of Space Commerce and AIA to Host Commercial Space Supply Chain Forum" title="Office of Space Commerce and AIA to Host Commercial Space Supply Chain Forum" rel="bookmark"><time class="timestamp updated" datetime="2026-07-24T13:00:25-04:00" itemprop="dateModified">July 24, 2026</time></a></span>				</span>
						<span class="entry-category">
				<span class='posted-in'><i class="icon-folder-open" aria-hidden="true"></i>
					Posted in <a href="https://space.commerce.gov/category/seminars-webinars/">Seminars &amp; Webinars</a>, <a href="https://space.commerce.gov/category/industrial-base/">Space Industrial Base</a>				</span>
			</span>
										<span class="entry-tag">
						<span class="post-data">
							Tagged with <a href="https://space.commerce.gov/tag/forum/" rel="tag">forum</a>, <a href="https://space.commerce.gov/tag/industrial-base/" rel="tag">industrial base</a>, <a href="https://space.commerce.gov/tag/seminar/" rel="tag">seminar</a>, <a href="https://space.commerce.gov/tag/supply-chain/" rel="tag">Supply Chain</a>						</span><!-- end of .post-data -->
										</span>
			</span>
			

</div><!-- end of .post-meta -->


<div class="entry-content" itemprop="text">
	
<div class="wp-block-responsive-block-editor-addons-image responsive-block-editor-addons-block-image block-c7936f8d-1440-4337-a291-1d95418ce63d"><div class="img-main-block"><figure class="img-block"><img decoding="async" class="responsive-blocks-image-block" src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""/></figure></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-responsive-block-editor-addons-divider responsive-block-editor-addons-block-spacer responsive-block-editor-addons-block-divider block-4f56d004-0983-4a68-a45c-9fee7981293f solid responsive-block-editor-addons-spacer-divider"><div class="responsive-block-editor-addons-divider-inner"><div class="responsive-block-editor-addons-divider-content"><hr class="responsive-block-editor-addons-divider_hr"/></div></div></div>



<p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">The Office of Space Commerce (OSC), in partnership with the <strong><a href="https://www.aia-aerospace.org/">Aerospace Industries Association</a> </strong>(AIA), will host the &#8220;<strong><a href="https://space.commerce.gov/issues-and-activities/commercial-space-supply-chain-forum/" data-type="page" data-id="14949">Commercial Space Supply Chain Forum</a></strong>&#8221; on <strong>August 18, 2026</strong>, at AIA headquarters in Arlington, Virginia.</p>



<p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">Space is limited. For registration details, please contact <a href="mailto:Space.Commerce@noaa.gov"><strong>Space.Commerce@noaa.gov</strong></a>.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-text-color has-responsive-global-palette-2-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-responsive-global-palette-2-background-color has-background is-style-dots"/>



<p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">The forum is the second in OSC&#8217;s &#8220;Commercial Space Competitiveness Forum&#8221; series, designed to strengthen the connection between the commercial space ecosystem and the federal government.</p>



<p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">The U.S. commercial space industry is growing rapidly, but that growth depends on an industrial base capable of keeping pace. Suppliers, manufacturers, integrators, and emerging technology companies face a range of interconnected challenges &#8211; from demand visibility and manufacturing capacity to component availability, testing and qualification, access to capital, and regulatory and compliance pressures.</p>



<p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">The Commercial Space Supply Chain Forum will bring together industry and government to examine these conditions through evidence-based discussions, panels, and hands-on working sessions.</p>



<p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">The Forum intends to identify practical policy priorities and actions that can strengthen the resilience and competitiveness of the U.S. commercial space industrial base.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-larger-font-size"><strong>Turning Industry Experience into Actionable Insight</strong></h3>



<p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">Forum discussions will address key issues affecting the commercial space industrial base, including:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li class="has-medium-font-size">Domestic manufacturing capacity</li>



<li class="has-medium-font-size">Tier 2 and Tier 3 supplier constraints</li>



<li class="has-medium-font-size">Supply chain dependencies and demand visibility</li>



<li class="has-medium-font-size">Capital access and manufacturing investment</li>



<li class="has-medium-font-size">Testing and qualification capacity</li>



<li class="has-medium-font-size">Regulatory and compliance pressures</li>



<li class="has-medium-font-size">Export considerations</li>



<li class="has-medium-font-size">Barriers to emerging technology adoption.</li>
</ul>



<p class="has-larger-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Event Details</strong></p>



<p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Date:</strong> August 18, 2026<br><strong>Time:</strong> 8:00 a.m. – 5:00 p.m.<br><strong>Location:</strong> Aerospace Industries Association</p>



<p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Your experience helps us understand the ecosystem. Your participation helps inform what comes next.</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
</div><!-- .entry-content -->


		
			</div><!-- end of .post-entry -->

	</article><!-- end of #post-15031 -->

